        "quote": "The City Council finds and declares as a matter of public policy that the identification, designation, protection, enhancement, preservation and use of historic assets is a public necessity and is required in the interest of the culture, prosperity, education and welfare of the public. Preservation of historic assets will:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.010:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.010 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "3066eb2d-6a94-50eb-a1e5-f34af0038b03",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 500,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.010:block:1",
          "start": 325
        },
        "quote": "(a) Protect, enhance and perpetuate historic, distinctive and important elements of the City’s cultural, social, economic, political, archaeological and architectural history;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.010:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.010 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "412c69c4-917a-5c7b-b7dc-ea5248b8ce95",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 607,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.010:block:2",
          "start": 501
        },
        "quote": "(b) Safeguard the City’s historic and cultural heritage as embodied and reflected in such historic assets;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.010:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.010 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "2379b8ec-6c58-5030-a533-471abc940422",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 731,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.010:block:3",
          "start": 608
        },
        "quote": "(c) Stabilize and improve property values in such locations of historic assets and thus strengthen the economy of the City;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.010:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.010 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "4a752479-98f0-51f7-8218-562fd5a83cbd",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
