          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.010:block:4",
          "start": 732
        },
        "quote": "(d) Promote and encourage restoration, rehabilitation, and maintenance of historic properties, neighborhoods and districts and thus combat blight and decay;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.010:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
